batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CountableSubsetOperator}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CountableSubsetOperator}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}countable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CountableSubsetOperator}_S(C,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nC=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(u)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}countable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CountableSubsetOperator}_S(C,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nC=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(u)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set builder is bounded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> and uses the canonical at-most-countable predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAncho